1
00:00:04,006 --> 00:00:08,541
Scientists use data to train models that rank which materials to test next.

2
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:11,628
In this case, every pipeline step passed.

3
00:00:11,628 --> 00:00:16,751
But one temperature-unit error pushed P-204 from rank 18 to rank 1 —

4
00:00:16,751 --> 00:00:20,317
sending the next weeks of lab work toward the wrong material.

5
00:00:20,317 --> 00:00:24,041
The pipeline succeeded. The scientific decision failed.

6
00:00:25,929 --> 00:00:28,560
The whole loop: detect the silent change,

7
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:32,295
prove exact impact with DataHub, contain selectively,

8
00:00:32,295 --> 00:00:36,138
repair with proof, and verify recovery before anything resumes.

9
00:00:38,114 --> 00:00:42,653
This file replays exactly what SciGuard did. First, live.

10
00:00:42,653 --> 00:00:46,786
The controller re-runs the science, reads DataHub context, applies policy —

11
00:00:46,786 --> 00:00:52,763
and in seconds the unsafe ranking is blocked, while independent work keeps moving.

12
00:00:54,434 --> 00:00:56,883
Then it pauses. That is deliberate.

13
00:00:56,883 --> 00:01:01,314
This public session cannot write to GitHub, DataHub, or production.

14
00:01:01,314 --> 00:01:04,731
The verified recovery continues from recorded evidence.

15
00:01:07,426 --> 00:01:09,598
Here is why DataHub is essential.

16
00:01:09,598 --> 00:01:13,198
The changed temperature field feeds the heat-resistance feature,

17
00:01:13,198 --> 00:01:17,563
the Tg model, and the candidate ranking. That branch halts.

18
00:01:17,563 --> 00:01:21,557
Molecular weight follows a separate lineage into the durability model.

19
00:01:21,557 --> 00:01:23,370
That branch continues.

20
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:26,550
SciGuard contains the decision, not the pipeline.

21
00:01:27,933 --> 00:01:33,736
In a 13-scenario evaluation, lineage recovered all three decision cones exactly.

22
00:01:33,736 --> 00:01:36,024
Search alone recovered none.

23
00:01:36,024 --> 00:01:39,703
Without DataHub, the agent abstained rather than guessing.

24
00:01:42,503 --> 00:01:47,543
SciGuard then delivers a reviewable repair: normalize Kelvin to Celsius;

25
00:01:47,543 --> 00:01:50,495
contract, ranking, and safe-branch tests; and a rollback plan —

26
00:01:50,495 --> 00:01:55,673
bound to a real GitHub pull request, three hosted checks,

27
00:01:55,673 --> 00:01:57,096
and the exact repair commit.

28
00:02:00,021 --> 00:02:02,930
An owner approval gate controls application.

29
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:07,868
Only after approval and two clean staging runs is recovery authorized.

30
00:02:07,868 --> 00:02:09,953
Production access remains off.

31
00:02:12,734 --> 00:02:17,878
Finally, SciGuard writes the resolution and a reusable Decision Log back to DataHub.

32
00:02:17,878 --> 00:02:22,617
Case closed — and every receipt in this file remains inspectable:

33
00:02:22,617 --> 00:02:26,509
the DataHub read-back, the evaluation report, the GitHub proof.

34
00:02:28,122 --> 00:02:32,326
The live session is isolated; production use is not claimed.

35
00:02:32,326 --> 00:02:37,034
The recovery skill is proposed upstream to DataHub's skills repository

36
00:02:37,034 --> 00:02:39,213
as draft PR #83.

37
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:50,377
Scientific AI should not merely act fast. It should earn the right to act.

38
00:02:50,377 --> 00:02:54,612
SciGuard protects the scientific decision — not just the data pipeline.

